      "role": "Portfolio/grid items in the hero masonry",
      "description": "Variable aspect-ratio rectangles filled with project thumbnails, minimal 4–10px radius, no border, no shadow. Arranged in a loose grid that mimics a designer's moodboard rather than a uniform product gallery. The tiles are the content — no chrome around them."
