      "name": "Caption / Eyebrow Label",
      "role": "Small uppercase or tight-set labels above headings or inside feature panels",
      "description": "Display face at 12–14px, weight 700, tracking tightened further (-0.025em). Sits above section headlines as a category tag. Sometimes reversed to white on dark cards."
